WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,690 --> 00:00:08,690
Call all these people over and don't panic.

2
00:00:08,690 --> 00:00:10,690
My aunt has already filled the porcelain vase with peach branches

3
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:11,690
Put it in Lou Yiniang’s yard

4
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:12,690
Just search for Lou Niang

5
00:00:12,690 --> 00:00:14,690
This matter has nothing to do with me

6
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:15,690
Lou Yiniang is not here

7
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:18,690
How could I logically suggest searching her yard?

8
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:19,690
How many of you

9
00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:22,690
Did you know that Miss Six would wear this hairpin yesterday?

10
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:23,690
But I told others

11
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:26,690
Or have you seen anyone with suspicious behavior?

12
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:29,390
Well, the slave definitely didn’t lie.

13
00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:30,390
Reply to the old lady

14
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:32,390
The afternoon before yesterday with my girl

15
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:33,390
I have been to the girl’s yard.

16
00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:34,390
But the girl was not there at the time

17
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:36,390
Tell the girl it's nothing important

18
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:37,390
After sitting for a while, he left

19
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:40,100
Old Madam Ming Jian

20
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,100
I did go to Ah Yuan’s yard the day before yesterday.

21
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:44,100
I wanted to go with her to pay my respects to my aunt.

22
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,100
Ah Yuan was not there at that time

23
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,100
I didn’t stay much longer

24
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,100
I am staying in the Hou Mansion

25
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,100
Taken in by my aunt

26
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:51,100
It’s not too late to be grateful
